-- accepted with W_UNICODE_NON_NORMALIZED_SOURCE_TEXT (with
-- deterministic recorded keys); this implementation takes the accepting
-- branch (§3.1.3 hygiene warning), under which the decomposed
-- reference and the composed declaration share one strictNameKey and
-- MUST resolve to the same binding.

